          "id": 419994039,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This is a totally wrong commit. First of all, the changes are done on transifex (where I translated to 100% russian, e.g.), second of all, it does not fix tne issue, because there are no such strings in translation. As of now ellipsis is not inluded in the tr() string. That is problem here.",
