      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 421622542,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I don't know why you switch threads. I already mentioned the discussion in the other issue.  \nThe documentation for translation (https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html_chunked/ChUIQt.html) does not say that transifex is the only way.\n\nIn the current version of master, the string including ellipsis is given to tr(); may be you should checkout master or fix your preprocessor: `tr(\"Decode As\" UTF8_HORIZONTAL_ELLIPSIS))`",
